# Project overrides

Global baseline: `~/AGENTS.md`. Hub: `~/Projects/AGENTS.md` when under `~/Projects/`.

Add project-specific rules below.

## Session boundary

You choose where a session ends. Everything in a session colours every later turn.

- One task per session. Do not start an unrelated task in the same session.
- Finishing a task is the natural point to clear. End there instead of carrying residue forward.
